<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<%# No ad loader. This is a form, well under the word count AdSense expects on a
    monetised page, and leaving the loader in lets Auto Ads place a unit on it
    from the account settings with no change here — the same reason /apply and
    /contact dropped it (docs/SEO_MISTAKES_LOG.md #20). The route also sets
    showAds = false, because a view can be edited back. %>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
<%# This page can be reached at /apply/track/<64 hex>, and that token is the
    credential. Two consequences the page has to handle itself:

    1. The Referer header. This page pulls a font stylesheet and Tailwind from
       two third-party hosts, and by default the browser tells them the full URL
       it is loading them from — handing the token to both. no-referrer stops
       that, and nothing here needs a referrer to work.
    2. The canonical tag. Left to the default it would print the token inside a
       <link rel="canonical">, i.e. copy the secret into a tag whose whole
       purpose is to be collected and passed around. It points at the tokenless
       form instead, which is also the honest canonical: every token renders the
       same page. %>
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
<title>متابعة حالة الطلب | OscarDevs</title>
<meta name="description" content="تابع حالة طلب إنشاء موقعك على منصّة OscarDevs." />
<%- include('../partials/seo_meta', { title: 'متابعة حالة الطلب — OscarDevs', description: 'تابع حالة طلب إنشاء موقعك على منصّة OscarDevs.', canonical: (typeof siteOrigin !== 'undefined' ? siteOrigin : '') + '/apply/status' }) %>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tw.css" />
<style>* { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; }</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">

<header class="bg-white shadow-sm">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="/ar" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-indigo-700">OscarDevs</a>
    <a href="/ar" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-indigo-700">← الرئيسية</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-6 sm:p-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2">متابعة حالة طلبك</h1>

    <%# The form sends the link, it does not show the status. Showing it here
        would mean this page answers questions about an email address to whoever
        types it — so the copy promises an email rather than an answer. %>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">لو معاك رابط المتابعة اللي بعتناه لك بعد التقديم، افتحه على طول. مش لاقيه؟ اكتب بريدك وهنبعتهولك تاني.</p>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm mb-5"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <% if (typeof sent !== 'undefined' && sent) { %>
      <%# Deliberately the same sentence whether or not an application exists. %>
      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-5">
        <p class="text-sm text-indigo-900 leading-7">لو فيه طلب مسجّل بالبريد ده، هيوصلك عليه رابط المتابعة خلال دقايق. بصّ في الـSpam كمان لو ماوصلش.</p>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <form method="POST" action="/apply/status" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-2">
      <input type="email" name="email" value="<%= email %>" required placeholder="you@email.com"
        class="flex-1 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-300" />
      <button type="submit" class="bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-800 transition shadow">ابعتلي الرابط</button>
    </form>

    <% if (result) { %>
      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-gray-100 pt-6">
        <% if (result.status === 'pending') { %>
          <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-700 font-bold mb-1">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block"></span> قيد المراجعة
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-amber-800">طلبك وصلنا وبيتراجع من فريقنا. هنفعّل حسابك قريباً، وبمجرد الموافقة هتقدر تدخل بنفس البريد وكلمة السر.</p>
          </div>
        <% } else if (result.status === 'approved') { %>
          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-green-700 font-bold mb-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              تمت الموافقة 🎉
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-green-800 mb-4">مبروك! موقعك اتفعّل. ادخل لوحة التحكم بنفس البريد وكلمة السر اللي سجّلت بهم عشان تظبط صفحتك.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
              <a href="/company/login" class="bg-green-600 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-700 transition shadow text-center">ادخل لوحة التحكم</a>
              <% if (result.company_slug) { %>
                <%# The canonical subdomain, computed in the route — /view/<slug>
                    only redirects there, and it is not the address the customer
                    will be told to use anywhere else. %>
                <a href="<%= result.site_url || ('/view/' + result.company_slug) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white border border-green-300 text-green-700 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition text-center">عاين موقعك</a>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% } else if (result.status === 'rejected') { %>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-red-700 font-bold mb-1">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 inline-block"></span> لم يتم القبول
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-red-800">للأسف لم يتم قبول طلبك. تواصل معنا على واتساب ونقولك السبب، أو <a href="/ar/apply" class="underline font-semibold">قدّم طلباً جديداً</a>.</p>
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">مفيش طلب مسجّل بهذا البريد. تأكّد من كتابته صح، أو <a href="/ar/apply" class="text-indigo-700 underline font-semibold">قدّم طلباً جديداً</a>.</p>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
